#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:35
msgid ""
"DM provides another layer of IRQ management on top of what the base driver "
"already provides. This is something that could be cleaned up, and is a "
"future TODO item."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:39
msgid ""
"The base driver provides IRQ source registration with DRM, handler "
"registration into the base driver's IRQ table, and a handler callback "
"amdgpu_irq_handler(), with which DRM calls on interrupts. This generic "
"handler looks up the IRQ table, and calls the respective :c:type:"
"`amdgpu_irq_src_funcs.process <amdgpu_irq_src_funcs>` hookups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:45
msgid ""
"What DM provides on top are two IRQ tables specifically for top-half and "
"bottom-half IRQ handling, with the bottom-half implementing workqueues:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:48
msgid ""
":c:type:`amdgpu_display_manager.irq_handler_list_high_tab "
"<amdgpu_display_manager>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:49
msgid ""
":c:type:`amdgpu_display_manager.irq_handler_list_low_tab "
"<amdgpu_display_manager>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:51
msgid ""
"They override the base driver's IRQ table, and the effect can be seen in the "
"hooks that DM provides for :c:type:`amdgpu_irq_src_funcs.process "
"<amdgpu_irq_src_funcs>`. They are all set to the DM generic handler "
"amdgpu_dm_irq_handler(), which looks up DM's IRQ tables. However, in order "
"for base driver to recognize this hook, DM still needs to register the IRQ "
"with the base driver. See dce110_register_irq_handlers() and "
"dcn10_register_irq_handlers()."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:26:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_irq.c:58
msgid ""
"To expose DC's hardware interrupt toggle to the base driver, DM implements :"
"c:type:`amdgpu_irq_src_funcs.set <amdgpu_irq_src_funcs>` hooks. Base driver "
"calls it through amdgpu_irq_update() to enable or disable the interrupt."
msgstr ""

