"by benchmark tools to analyze display system performance. The function may "
"take several milliseconds to execute due to hardware measurement "
"requirements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/display/display-manager:71:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/dc/dc.h:3538
msgid ""
"QoS information includes: - Bandwidth bounds (lower limits in Mbps) - "
"Latency bounds (upper limits in nanoseconds) - Hardware-measured bandwidth "
"metrics (peak/average in Mbps) - Hardware-measured latency metrics (maximum/"
"average in nanoseconds)"
